@startuml F1.8-D02-tipos-elegiveis
title F1.8-D02 — Tipos de solicitação elegíveis
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestTypesController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: Nova solicitação
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /request-types
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT tipos elegíveis\n(+ form_schema)
Postgres --> Ctrl: só elegíveis
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Aluno: grid de cards

@enduml
